start
:Identify actual activity, date, method and coverage;
:Record participants or exact inspected source / revision;
:Capture labeled statement, paraphrase or observation;
:Separate interpretation, assumptions and proposed solutions;
:Check source fidelity, context and existing decision authority;
if (Actual interpretation review performed?) then (yes)
 :Record feedback, reviewer / date and reviewed scope; <<#173B34>>
else (not yet)
 :Keep interpretation pending owner review; <<#49351C>>
endif
:Record open detail, conflicts, owner and dependent gate;
:Link actual requirements / scenarios / questions when allocated;
:Preserve source locator, record identity and correction history;
